            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Astronomical 0.2.67

## Fixed

- Upgrading no longer prevents the server from starting when the configuration file contains settings for features that were removed in 0.2.66 (the retired Qwen thinking-channel seed and multi-token prediction acceleration). Such settings are now dropped with a warning and the sanitized configuration is saved.
- The published configuration schema no longer references the removed acceleration section.
]]></description>
